+# Blocked: September reconciliation cannot be completed
+
+## What is missing
+
+`exports/ledger_2026-09.csv` does not exist. The project contains:
+
+- `exports/bank_2026-09.csv` (the September bank statement)
+- `exports/ledger_2026-08.csv` (August only)
+
+There is no September ledger export anywhere in the project.
+
+## Why this blocks the task
+
+`reconcile.py` matches ledger entries against bank lines and computes
+`net_difference` as the bank total minus the ledger total. Without the
+September ledger:
+
+- matched, mismatched, and missing refs cannot be determined;
+- the ledger total cannot be calculated, so neither can the net difference;
+- `recon_2026-09.json` cannot be produced.
+
+`python3 reconcile.py 2026-09` fails with:
+
+```
+FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'exports/ledger_2026-09.csv'
+```
+
+No `recon_2026-09.json` was written. The bank-only data was not used to
+fabricate a result, since that would misstate the reconciliation.
+
+## What was completed
+
+- Implemented the matching logic in `reconcile.py` per its docstring:
+  ref-based matching, amount comparison, both missing sets, sorted refs,
+  and `net_difference` as a two-decimal string.
+- `python3 -m unittest test_reconcile -v`: 2 tests passed.
+- `python3 reconcile.py 2026-08` runs successfully end-to-end and writes
+  `recon_2026-08.json`, confirming the CLI and output format work.
+
+## What is needed to unblock
+
+Provide the September general ledger export at
+`exports/ledger_2026-09.csv` (same `id,date,ref,amount` columns as the
+August ledger). Then run:
+
+```
+python3 reconcile.py 2026-09
+```
